WEBVTT

00:02:56.956 --> 00:03:01.196
tools and power to make
change in our lives

00:03:01.236 --> 00:03:02.836
and in the world.

00:03:02.876 --> 00:03:06.116
Education is a basic right
for all children,

00:03:06.156 --> 00:03:08.996
especially for those who have grown up

00:03:08.996 --> 00:03:11.196
only knowing violence and conflict.

00:03:11.636 --> 00:03:17.076
And education, also, is the way
we make our future more secure

00:03:17.116 --> 00:03:19.556
and our present more peaceful.

00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:22.636
A generation needs power to make change.

00:03:22.676 --> 00:03:25.676
And the greatest power
that's ever known to all

00:03:25.676 --> 00:03:27.276
is the power of knowledge.

00:03:28.036 --> 00:03:29.956
When I read books,

00:03:29.996 --> 00:03:34.196
I feel like I'm no longer
in my tiny room made of hay